<title>USA: TechComm Group MD named CEO of U.S. group.</title>
<headline>TechComm Group MD named CEO of U.S. group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esprit Telecom Group Plc said Wednesday that it has named David Oertle chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Oertle is currently chief executive officer and managing director of TechComm Group and will assume the role of Esprit Telecom's chief executive officer on May 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Walt Anderson, the company's current chief executive officer will remain with Esprit Telecom as chairman of the company.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
